---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getUi } from '@/i18n/ui';
import { SDMX_API_BASE } from '@/data/sdmx-catalog';

const lang = 'en';
const t = getUi(lang);
---

<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={t.methodology.title}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>{t.methodology.title}</h1>
    <p class="lead">{t.methodology.lead}</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Derzhstat SDMX</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Dataflow catalog: <code>{SDMX_API_BASE}/dataflow/all/all/latest</code> (125 flows as of 2026-10-11 checks).</li>
        <li>Regional availability: <code>/availableconstraint/&lt;DF&gt;/all/all/REGION</code>.</li>
        <li>Data: <code>/data/&lt;DF&gt;/&lt;key&gt;?startPeriod=YYYY</code>. Keys must not start with «.» — put indicator codes first.</li>
        <li><code>c[REGION]=</code> filters are ignored; CSV Accept often returns 404 — we use XML.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Chain stores (OSM) &amp; HoReCa</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Chain stores:</strong> Geofabrik OSM snapshots, brand matching, official locators for completeness, ATB corrected using press anchors. CSVs in <code>public/data/</code>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Food service:</strong> Derzhstat KVED section I (oblast); OSM food amenities via ohsome Jan-1 snapshots.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Hromada rankings &amp; work.ua</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/mikerudine/rebuild-ukraine-hromada-growth" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kaggle: rebuild-ukraine-hromada-growth</a> — legal-entity/FOP growth 2021→2025, zones, composite (Derzhstat business register).
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.work.ua/stat/" rel="noopener noreferrer">work.ua/stat</a> — monthly median advertised salaries and vacancy counts by city (<code>public/data/workua_city_monthly.csv</code>).
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Other sources (cases)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Media, hromada sites, SHABO materials — linked on case pages.</li>
        <li><strong>api.openbudget.gov.ua</strong> — expected hromada budget API; not verified from build infrastructure. No budget figures until verified.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Limitations</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No village/hromada population in SDMX; <code>DF_POPULATION_STRUCTURE</code> is oblast-level.</li>
        <li>War-related coverage gaps from 2022 onward in official metadata.</li>
        <li>2020 amalgamation changed hromada boundaries; KATOTTG vs legacy KOATUU.</li>
        <li>Every chart ships with JSON including <code>source</code>, <code>fetched_at</code>, and query URL.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Build pipeline</h2>
      <p>
        Before <code>astro build</code>, <code>scripts/fetch-sdmx.ts</code> pulls verified series into <code>public/data/</code>. GitHub Actions deploys static output to Pages with <code>base: /rebuild/</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
